   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the Acme Magnesium supplement bottle in <Picture 1>, with its exact label text, shape and colors.\n<Audio 1> is the voice-timbre reference for the woman (S1).\n\nsummary:\n[keyframe completion + reference generation + audio reference] A realistic UGC selfie video of a warm, relatable American woman in her fifties, with shoulder-length brown hair worn down and a soft blue cardigan in her bright kitchen in soft morning light, standing at the counter, who shows <Subject 1> to the camera.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the label text, shape and colors of the product are retained.\n<Audio 1>: reference - the speaker follows the voice timbre, accent, pitch and pace of <Audio 1> without copying the original signal.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a realistic UGC iPhone selfie video, vertical 9:16, one continuous handheld front-camera take with a subtle natural sway, small arm micro-jitters, autofocus gently re-focusing and natural exposure shifts. Real unretouched skin with visible pores, fine lines and natural shine, flyaway hairs and mild phone-camera noise. [Shot 1] The shot opens on a warm, relatable American woman in her fifties, with shoulder-length brown hair worn down and a soft blue cardigan, in her bright kitchen in soft morning light, standing at the counter. A plain white unlabeled pill jar stands upright on the counter in the lower right of the frame. Her phone hand stretches toward the lens at the lower left edge of the frame; that phone is the camera. Her free hand holds the bottle (<Subject 1>) up beside her face, label facing the lens. [0.2s-3.4s] The woman on screen (S1), using the voice timbre referenced from <Audio 1>, holds the bottle (<Subject 1>) steady beside her face, label to the lens, and says: <d>[English] This is the one I actually kept taking.</d> She closes her lips. [3.7s-6.5s] She (S1) holds the bottle still beside her face with a small honest smile and says: <d>[English] Here is what is on the label.</d> She closes her lips. [6.5s-7.3s] She holds eye contact with a small natural smile. The woman stays the same person with natural hands for the whole shot, and everything important stays in the center of the frame.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nClose iPhone microphone audio with a slightly compressed, room-echoey voice, the room's own quiet natural tone throughout.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"
   ],
   "title": "PROMPT \u00b7 take 3 in MiniMax's format (`take_graph.py --print-prompt`)",
